('112.4.b.12.C',3,'Some seeds have hooks that stick to fur. How does this help the plant?','["the seeds stay in one place", "the plant makes less seeds", "an animal carries the seeds away", "the seeds melt"]'::jsonb,2,'Hooks catch on animals and travel to new places.','original'),
